        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1af43e4a-5b91-45f4-8374-0a4e059adacc).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rWe have a new anonymous client. He wants to put to the test the great things he’s heard about you. The most popular nightclub in Germany... that is your next destination.\r\rOur new client is a rich bastard who kills these targets simply because he dislikes the music or the person involved. Naturally, he isn&apos;t about to get his own hands dirty—that’s where you come in.\r\rYou’d best avoid ending up on his hit list, the ICA has already sanctioned the assassination.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
